.idea
# Claude Code / agent settings - ALL of it stays local. A committed settings.json
# ships one machine's accumulated permission grants (and its absolute paths) to
# every fork, where they would be pre-approved for someone else's agent.
.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
__pycache__
.pytest_cache/
**.egg-info
**/build
**/data
**/quam_state
state_lib/
assets
# No repo-local venv belongs here - the tests run in the shared .venv-qm (ENVIRONMENTS.md).
.venv*
**/calibration_data
/.img
tempCodeRunnerFile.python
temp/

# Official qua-libs files are vendored (copied) into calibrations/ and
# calibration_utils/ by sync_official.py and ARE tracked in git, so they are
# intentionally NOT ignored here. Do not edit the vendored files in place;
# update upstream and re-run `python sync_official.py`.
**/quam_state_6q
